Overlays on the Guidance for Deploying a Prebid Server on AWS
=============================================================

The patches under patches/ and the script amt-bidder/copy-fast-ctv.sh modify, and are applied to, the Guidance for
Deploying a Prebid Server on AWS, release v1.4.0 (commit 0c7e7e714de37d1f56b29219d7ad9e6d17fac6b2),
https://github.com/aws-solutions-library-samples/prebid-server-deployment-on-aws

