The guidance itself is not redistributed in this repository: scripts/prebid_guidance.py fetches it from its
repository at the pinned commit into build/prebid-guidance/, which is never committed. Its NOTICE.txt lists the
third-party components it includes.

Each patch states what it changes and why, and every file it changes gains a comment naming the overlay
("Overlay O<n> (FAST Channels)"), the prominent notice of the Apache License 2.0, section 4(b). The patches and
amt-bidder/copy-fast-ctv.sh are distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, like the files they modify.
